<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">-NAMBYA TRANSLATION PROJECT</book>
  <para style="h">BaLoma</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lukwalo lwaPaulu KubaLoma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Loma</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lom</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lukwalo lwaPaulo</para>
  <para style="mt1">KUBALOMA</para>
  <para style="imt">Matangisilo</para>
  <para style="ip">Matangisilo ewhalo yabaLoma: Iwhalo yabaLoma ingaba yakakwalwa nompositoli Paulu pakati pamakole makumi mashanu ana mane namakumi mashanu ana tushanu notutatu Jesu asanu azwalwa. Paulu ajakabanu ashanyila kuLoma, nezwo wakatumila lukwalo yolu kuti elaye maKristo muLoma bakabe shanganisila baJuda nabasi baJuda. Paulu wakakwalila kuti induji jose jidimbwe nokuwhilila Jesu Kristo (16:26). Iwhalo yabaloma ilokosha kasa kubaKristo kunyika jose akale nonshaji wose nokuda kwenzila Paulu yaakabiga pachena nokupandulula zwizhele pezhulu poluchijo lwatingawana munaJesu Kristo. Paulu akale wakashanganisa iNdebo iMbuya yaJesu Kristo nechivumilano chantolo. Babhati boluzibo banji banoti ivesi ilobhata zose muwhalo yeyi ndi 1:16 inoti, “Andina ishoni pezhulu peNdebo iMbuya, nokuti isimba lyaMwali lyokuchija aani nani unodimbwa, unJuda kutanga, kusikotobela wokuzhe.” Chikamu chotanga chabaLoma (1-12) chilojika miji mundayijo yozokudimbwa kusikoti chikamu chabili (13-15) chilinozwilayijo zokutiwa mubupenyu boNkristu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Zwilomumwa:</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Paulu unotanga sezwaanogala eta nokuzwisuma iye akale nokuleba kuti ukumukwalila aani (1:1-15) 2. Esikokwala pezhulu pamamililo abanhu nokuti bangawana luchijo munaJesu Kristo (1.16-11.36) 3 Mushule mezwi Paulo unopa indayo inji yokuta yokulalama chiKristo (12:1-15.13) 4 Unopejisa baLoma nokupa kumusa kulosiyanasiyana kubanhu mugubungano kuLoma (16).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Imi Paulu undanda, waJesu Kristo, ndakashobwa kuba umpositoli weNdebo iMbuya yaMwali.<verse eid="ROM 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Yaakabimbisa ntolo nabapolofeti babe mumakwalo machena, <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />iNdebo inolebeleka pezhulu poMwananhulumyana uwe, wakazwalwa kunzwalo yaDavidi nokwenyama <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />akale akatondejelwa kuti Mwananhulumyana waMwali, mumasimba nokundila mumpepo wobuchena, nokumuka kukwe mubafi, Jesu Kristo Tezi wedu, <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />nomunaiye takatambula chipiwo nobupositoli kuti kube ipo kuwhilila kokudimbwa, kunduji jose nokuda kwezina lilye, <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />kushanganisa namwi bakashobwa kuti mube baJesu Kristo.<verse eid="ROM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Kunamwi mose badiwa baMwali bokuRoma, mwakashobelwa kuba bachena.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:7">Chipiwo nolunyalalo lwaMwali Tate bedu naShe Jesu Kristo zwibe kwamuli.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unamato wokuboka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Kutanga ndinoboka Mwali wangu kunaJesu Kristo, pezhulu penu mose, nokuti kudimbwa kwenu kumupupulwa munyika yose. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Mwali wandinonamata nompepo wangu muNdebo iMbuya yoMwananhulumyana uwe, ndiye unsumikiji wangu kuti ndosomubanda mazhuba ose muminamato yangu, <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />ndikumbila kuti ndibe nonshaji wokuzha kwamuli kana Mwali eda. <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Nokuti ndinodisisa kumubona kuti ndimukobele chipo chompepo kuti musimiswe, <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />zwinoleba kuti tisungwajane imwi nami nokudimbwa kwedu.<verse eid="ROM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Ndinoda kuti muzibe banakwaina kuti ndakaba ndida kuzha kwamuli kuti ndoowana michelo nokunamwi nokunejimwe induji jaBokuzhe (koga ndakachelejwa kanji kujine kube ngweno). <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Ndina unshingo kubaGiliki nokubanhu banangalilo unolingilwa pasi, kuna banabuchenjevu namalema, <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />zwakadalo ndinodisisa kuti ndibuze iNdebo iMbuya kwamuli bokuRoma.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masimba eNdebo iMbuya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Nokuti andina ishoni neNdebo iMbuya; ilyo isimba lyaMwali linochija bose banovumila kutanga kuNjuda akale nokuNgiliki. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Nokuti kululama kwaMwali kunotondejelwa muna iyo kutanga nokudimbwa chete; sobuzwakakwalwa kuwhi, Wakalulama unolalama nokudimbwa.”<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Undandu wonhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Nokuti bukali bwaMwali bunotondejelwa buva kudenga pabuhungu bwose nobubi, bwabanhu banosisa ichokomende mububi bwabo. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Nokuti zwakazibiswa naMwali zwipopachena kwabali nokuti iye Mwali nokukwe wakazwibiga pachena. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Kuvila pakubumbwa kwenyika chimo chiche chisinoboneka nesimba lilye lisinopela nobumwali bubwe, zwakaboneka kasa zwitondejelwa panezwakabumbwa. Ndizwo besina inzila yokuzwilandulila, <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />nokudalo kojoba bakounziba Mwali abajakonkuja kana kuumboka saMwali, kuyeya kwabo akujakabechinoshinga, akale nendangalilo jabo jakaswibhijwa. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Mukuzwita bachenjevu bakaba malema, <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />bakashandula lukujo lwaMwali usinofa, bakata zwitojaniso zwonhu unofa, nozwenyuni nozwemhuka nozwamakabi.<verse eid="ROM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Nokudalo Mwali wakabalamwa kuti bete zwilakamilo zwemyoyo yabo zwobuhungu, nezwinosheshemesa nemibili yabo chabo chabo. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Nokuti bakashandula ichokomende lyaMwali bakalita mayabwe, bakanamata bekuja zwibumbwa kupinda uMbumbi, iye unokwelela kukujwa kujine kube lini nalini! Ameni.<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Ndizwo Mwali wakabalekeja mukukwemujwa kwabo. Nabechinhukaji babo bakashandula zwito zwabo zwebhatuko beta zwisilozibilika, <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />nenzila imwempela banhulume bakasiya kudanana nabechinhukaji bakakwemujana chabo chabo, banhulume beta zwito zwinopisa ishoni, nezwo bakawana indipilo ilokwelela kulundula lwabo.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Sezwibasakada kuziba Mwali, Mwali wakabalamwa kuti bebe nendangalilio jilohunguka, beta zwisakalulama. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Nokudalo bakandyondyomela muna zwisilolulama zwose, bubi, ifupa nolunya. Bakazhala noluchibo, nobubulayi, nokunyenyejana, nobuchengeji nobukali beli banyeyi, <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />banonyepejela, nabanobenga Mwali nabamachinzebe nabanoshiya nabanozwitunhumwija nabanolonga zwibi nabasinowhilila bazwali, <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />namalema nabasinodimbwa nabasinaludo nabasinowhila ishe. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Kojoba beziba mulawo waMwali unoti yabo banochinya alo balokwelela kufa chete, ibo abatochinya chete asi banosungwaja bamwe kuta zwakalezwo.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s">Untongo waMwali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Nokudalo auna inzila yokuzwilwila, Iwi nhu, kojoba ube aani paunoshungula umwe; nokuti yopo paunotonga umwe ukumuzwipa undandu iwi nokuko, nokuti iwi ntongi ukumuta zwakalezwo bo. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Tinoziba kuti kutonga kwaMwali ndikwechokomende kunobhulukila yabo banota zwakadalo. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Unoyeya kuti, Iwi unhu, kana utonga bamwe banota zwakadai nawi uzwita, ungapujumuka kubutongo bwaMwali na? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Kana kushunda bukulwana bweshe jije, nokutobeleja nokuba nomwoyo undefu kukwe? Autoziba kuti yeji ishe jaMwali jilokwelela kukutungamilila mukushanduka na? <verse eid="ROM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Nobukukutu bomwoyo akale nokusozwifhija ukumuzwikwilikila nokukwo bukali nezhuba lyobukali, nezhuba lyokuzwitondeja kwokutonga kwaMwali kulolulama. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />Iye unoolipa umwe nomwe zwinda nemishingo yiye; <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />kuna yabo banoti nokuwhilila, nokuta zwibuya beshaka lukujo nempuwo imbuya, nokusofa, unoobapa bupenyu businopela. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Koga yabo banonyenyeja, besinolemesa ichokomende, bewhilila manyepwa banotilwa bukali nokunyemelwa. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Kunooba injabulo nokulwajilwa, kwonhu wose unota zwisakalulama kutanga kubaJuda zwizha kubaGiliki, <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />koga lukujo nempuwo nolunyalalo kuna yabo bose banota zwilolulama, kutanga noJuda zwinda kunGiliki. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Nokuti Mwali aana inshalulo.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Bose bakachinya besina mulawo, banoopalala bakadalo besina Mulawo, naabo bakachinya beli pasi pomulawu, banootongeswa nooyo Mulawo. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Nokuti atoba banowha Mulawo balolulama mbeli kwaMwali, koga banota zwomuMulawu, ndibo bachalulamiswa. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Kana Bokuzhe basina mulawo beta zwinhu zwomulawo nenzila yozwebhatuko lyabo, ibo bomene banoba mulawo kwabali, kojoba besina mulawo. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Yezwi zwinotondejela kuti zwinodikanwa nomulawo zwakakwalwa mumyoyo yabo, akale luyeyo lwabo lunoba unsumikiji, kunyenyezana kwendangalilo jabo kunobapa undandu kana chimwe chilo kubalandula, <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />nelyo izhuba, sokuleba kweNdebo iMbuya yangu, Mwali unotonga isiswa lyabanhu munaKristo She.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">BaJuda noMulawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Kana uzwishoba uti unJuda, ubimba nomulawo akale uzwitunha nokukamujana kukwo naMwali <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />akale uziba chido chiche nokuvumila zwibuyanana, nokuti ulolayijwa mumulawo, <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />ulinelebeswa kuti ndiwi untungamili kunabo basina mesho, uli chimuniko chaabo baimo munhilima, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />uli unkololi wamalema, undayiji wabana nokuti iwi unaluzibo nechokomende chomulawo. <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Iwi unolayija bamwe autozwilayijabo na? Iwi unobhaunula kuti kusikwibwe, iwi unokwiba na? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Iwi unoti unhu esipombole, iwi unopombola na? Iwi unoshunda zwibezhwa, unopamba mumatempeli na? <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Iwi unozwikuja pezhulu pomulawo, autolemekeja Mwali nokuvuna milawu na? <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Sezwilokwalwa kuti, ‘Izina lyaMwali linoshundwa pakati paBokuzhe pezhulu penu.’<verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Chokomende, kumhalaja kunobhancha kana ulondota Mulawo koga kana uli usinotobela Mulawo, kumhalaja kuko kunoba sousakamhalajwa. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Koga kana usakamhalajwa elondota zwilayijo zwomulawo, andimo na kuti unokwelaniswa nowakamhalajwa? <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Nezwo yabo banoti kojoba besakamhalajwa nokwebhatuko asi belondota mulawo, banoomupa undandu imwi munotaluka Mulawo, kojoba mwakamhalajwa akale mukakwalilwa mulawo. <verse eid="ROM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Nokuti unJuda welebeswa atoba kwokumesho chete kana kumhalajwa kwombili koga, kumhalajwa kwomumwoyo. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />UnJuda womene ndiyoyo womukati, nokumhalajwa kwomene kwimo mumwoyo kusi ikwo kwomulawu kwakakwalwa koga kuli kwompepo. Kutunhumwijwa kukwe akutova kubanhu koga kunaMwali.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="s">Zwibimbiso zwaMwali Azwitobachija</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Biya unJuda unopinda bamwe neni? Ani kumhalajwa kuna lubhanchoni? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Kasa munzila inji. Kokutanga baJuda bakapiwa iwhi lyaMwali. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Ani ngana bamwe bakaba besinobimbika? Kusobimbika kwabo kunoota na kuti kubimbika kwaMwali kusibe ipo? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Mane! Mwali ngebe ichokomende, kojoba unhu wose enyepa sokukwalwa kwazo kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">“Utondeje kululama kukwo mumawhi awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:4">akale ubhudilile pakutongwa kukwo.”<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Koga kana bubi bwedu butondejela bululami bwaMwali, tinotini? Kuti Mwali aajilolulama kubuza bukali bubwe panasu? (Ndimulebeleka sonhu wenyama). <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Mane akujili alo! Mwali walutonga chini inyika?.<verse eid="ROM 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Koga kana nokunyepa kwangu kuli isimiso lyaMwali lyakubusa lukujo lulwe, ndichinolashilwani biya sonchinyi. <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Biya ini kusinotiwa bubi kuti bubuya buzhe? Sezwo bamwe betipita nokulebeleka kwabo. Kulashwa kwabo kulokwelela.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apana ulolulama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Biya ini? Isu baJuda, tinobapinda na? Mane, atitobapinda; Nokuti ndazwibona kuti banhu bose, baJuda nabaGiliki baipo pasi pesimba loluchinyo, <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />Sezwo zwilokwalwa kuwhi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">“Apana ulolulama, apana kana umwempela;<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />apana unowhisisa, apana unopyanga Mwali.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Bose bakapambuka, bakalundula pamwempela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">apana unota bubuya, apana kana nomwempelazwe.”<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />“Ihulo jabo makumbu alozhulika, banoshingisa lulimi lwabo pakuchengeja,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">butulu bwenyoka bupo pemilomo yabo.”<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />“Milomo yabo izhele kufizha nolunyemo.”<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />“Makumbo abo anokambijila kunokutula ilopa,<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />munzila jabo munakupalaja nenjabulo.<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />Akale nenzila yolunyalalo abatoyiziba.”<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />“Lutyo lwaMwali alumo mumesho abo.”<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Ngweno tinoziba kuti zwose zwinolebwa nomulawu lunolebeleka kunabo baipo pasi pomulawu kutila kuti wose undomo umiswe, akale inyika yose ibe pasi pobutongo bwaMwali. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Nezwo akuna unhu uchawhi wakalulama mumesho aMwali pezhulu pemishingo yomulawo, nokuti nomulawu kunozha luzibo lwoluchinyo.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tolulamiswa chini kunaMwali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Koga kwangweno bululami bwaMwali bwakatondejelwa kuzhe komulawu kojoba bwakasumikijwa nomulawu nabapolofeti, <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />kululama kwaMwali kunova mukudimbwa munaJesu Kristo kuna bose banodimbwa. Nokuti akuna unsiyano; <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />tose tilochinya, atitoswikila kabuchena bwaMwali, <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />balolulamiswa neshe jije sechipo mukumunulwa kumwo munaKristo Jesu, <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />iye wakabigwa naMwali kuti, nelopa lilye ebe undipo unotambulwa nokudimbwa. Yezwi zwakabeli zwinotondejela bululami bwaMwali nokuti mubuchena bubwe wakawhila ishe muluchinyo lwokumatangisilo; <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />kwakabeli kusimatija panoyo unshaji kuti iye emene wakakululama, akale unosimatija yoyo unodimbwa munaJesu.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Biya kuzwitunha kwedu kupoponi? Kulosiyiwa. Pezhulu peni? Pezhulu pemishingo na? Mane, asi pezhulu pokudimbwa. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Nezwo tinoti unhu unolulamiswa nokudimbwa, kuzhe kwemishingo yomulawo. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Ani Mwali ngowabaJuda chete na?Aatoba Mwali waBokuzhe bo na? Eya ngowaBokuzhe bo, <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />sezwo Mwali umwempela, akale ndiye unoolulamisa bakamhalajwa pezhulu pokudimbwa kwabo akale basakamhalajwa nokudimbwa kwabo. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Nezwo tingalasha mulawo nokukudimbwa na? Azwili alo ne, koga tinosimisa mulawo.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s">Chitondejelo chaAbhulahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Ini zwatingalebe nozwaAbhulahamu, tategulu bedu, nokwenyama? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Kana Abhulahamu akalulamiswa nemishingo, una nechinhu chaanozwifufumula nacho koga kusi mbeli kwaMwali. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Nezwo iwhalo inchena inotini, “Abhulahamu wakadimbwa kuna Mwali, nokudalo wakabalilwa sonhu wakalulama.” <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Ngweno kunoyu unoshingila, indipilo yiye aitotolwa sechipo asi sechinhu chaanokwelela kuwana. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Akale kunoyo usinoshinga koga ebimba yoyo unolulamisa yabo basinoziba Mwali, kuvumila kukwe kunolingwa sokululama. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Nezwo Davidi unoshobelela chikombolelo ponhu unolingililwa naMwali sowakalulama kusina mishingo.<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />“ Balokombolelwa yabo bana zwibi zwakalekejelwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">akale nabo banaluchinyo lulojimwa,<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Ulokombolelwa unhu unaluchinyo lusinolangalilwa naShe.<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Yechi chikombolelo ngechabakamhalajwa chete na kana nabasijilomhalajwa? Tinoti kudimbwa kwaAbhulahamu kwakatolwa sobululami. <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Bwakabalilwa chini biya kwaali? Esanhu amhalajwa kana amhalajwa? Yezwi azwijakatikana amhalajwa koga esanhu. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Wakatambula kumhalajwa sechitondejelo kana untalo wabakalulama kwaakaba elinako mukudimbwa esanhu amhalajwa.Chinangwa chakaba chokuti beunte tate babo bose bakavumila besakamhalajwa akale kuti kululama kubalilwe kwabali. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Akale eli tate babakamhalajwa, nabo basaka mhalajwa koga betobela unkwejaniso wokudimbwa kwaluba na tate bedu Abhulahamu kwaakaba nako esanhu amhalajwa.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chibimbiso chaMwali chinotambulwa nokudimbwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Chibimbiso kuna Abhulahamu nenzwalo yiye, ngechokuti balokwelela kuwana ifuma yenyika, yezwi azwijakezha nomulawu asi nokululama kokudimbwa, <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />kana beli batobeli bomulawo bachaba balyi befuma kudimbwa akuna nshingo akale nechibimbiso achitobhancha. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Nokudalo mulawo unobuza bukali, asi pasina mulawo apana luchinyo.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Ndizwo kuwhi zwinonda nokudimbwa, kutila kuti chibimbiso chinyetutukile pezhulu pechipiwo akale kupiwe bose benzwalo yiye, kusi kuna banobhatilila kumulawo asi kunaibo bose banokobelana kudimbwa kwaAbhulahamu nokuti nditate bedu tose, <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />sezwo kukakwalwa kuwhi, “Ndakuta tate benduji inji” mukuba ipo kwaMwali munaiye waakadimbwa, Iye unopa bupenyu kuna bakafa akale etukobuza mubupenyu zwinhu zwisipo. <verse eid="ROM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Mulubimbo wakavumila kubimba kojoba pakabechisina chitondejelo cholubimbo, kuti unokwelela kuba tate benduji inji, sokubujwa kukwe kuti, “Inzwalo iyo inowanda.” <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Ajakazengelela mukudimbwa yopo paakalinga umbili uwe, wakababa sowafa nokuti waluba namakole, angaba izana kana yopo paakalangalila bumhanje bwaSala. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Apana kusodimbwa kwakatisa kuti elashe chibimbiso chaMwali, koga wakasima mukudimbwa epa lukujo kunaMwali, <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />eka gutisika kuti Mwali unotubula kuta zwakabimbisa. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Ndizwo kuvumila kukwe, “kwakatolwa kwaali sobululami.” <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Asi mawhi anoti, “kwakatolwa kwaali,” aajakakwalilwa iye ega, <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />asi isu neebo. Zwinoolangalilwa kwatili isu tinovumila mwaali iye Jesu Tezi wedu wakamuswa mubafi, <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />Ndiyani iye wakabulayiwa pezhulu poluchinyo lwedu, akamuswa kuti tilulamiswe.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s">Kumunulwa kwedu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Nokudalo, sezwo tikalulamiswa nokudimbwa, tina nolunyalalo naMwali muna iye Tezi wedu Jesu Kristo. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Nomuna iye takawana mangwinilo omuchipiwo mwatigele akale tinoshanta nolubimbo lwedu lwokukobelana lukujo lwaMwali. <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Azwitoba izwo chete koga, tinoshanta mukuyabula kwedu, tili noluzibo kuti kuyabula kunobuza kushingilila, <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />kushingilila kunokusimisa, kusima kunobuza kubimba, <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />nokubimba akutotilashisa, nokuti ludo lwaMwali lulodilwa mumyoyo yedu zwiva muMpepo uNchena watilopiwa.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Patakaba tili balodemuka, Kristo wakafila basijaluziba Mwali panshaji wakakwelela. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Azwitoba zwilelu kuti umwe efile unhu ulolulama - asi angaba ipo umwe angada kufila unhu umbuya. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Asi Mwali unotondejela ludo lulwe kwatili pakuti Kristo wakatifila tichibachinyi. <verse eid="ROM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Sezwo tiwhi takalulama pezhulu pelopa lilye, tichoochijwa naiye kuva mubukali bwaMwali. <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Kana patakaba tili babengi naye, takachingunukila kunaMwali pezhulu polufu lwoMwananhulumyana uwe, sezwo tachingunukila kuna iye, tinochijwa nobupenyu bubwe. <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Azwitoba yezwi chete, koga tinoshanta munaMwali pezhulu paTezi wedu Jesu Kristo, munaiye mwatakatambula luchingunuko.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adamu naKristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Sezwo luchinyo lwakezha munyika pezhulu ponhu umwempela, nolufu pezhulu poluchinyo, nokudalo lufu lwakazhila kubanhu bose nokuti bose banhu bakachinya <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />luchinyo lwakabelimo munyika, mulawo usanu watalwa, koga luchinyo alutobalilwa pasina mulawo. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Asi lufu lwakatonga kuva kunaAdamu kunoswika kunaMozesi, nabo bakaba nezwibi zwisalukwendelana nenzila yokuchinya kwaAdamu, iye wakabeli nechimo choyo waluzha. <verse eid="ROM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Asi chipo cheshe achitanga sokuchinya. Kana banji bakafa pezhulu poluchinyo lwonhu umwempela, isimiso kuti chipiwo chaMwali nechipo cheshe jonhu yondya umwempela Jesu Kristo chinozhalilana kubanji. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Asi chipo cheshe achitanga soluchinyo lwakezha nonhu umwempela. Nokuti untongo wakatobela luchinyo lumwempela lwakabuza kulashwa, asi chipo cheshe chinotobeleja luchinyo lunji chinobuza kululamiswa. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Kana kuli kuti lufu lwakatonga nokuda kwoyo unhu umwempela wakachinya, isimiso kuti bachatambula bunji bwechiChipiwo nechipo cheshe chokululama, banootonga mubupenyu pezhulu ponhu umwempela, Jesu Kristo.<verse eid="ROM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Sezwo kuchinya kwonhu umwempela kwakabuza kulashwa kwabanhu bose, nokudalo chito chonhu umwempela chibuya, chinosupula banhu bose chibapa bupenyu. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Sezwo nokusowhilila kwonhu umwempela, banji bakatiwa bachinyi, zwakadalo bo kuti nokuwhilila kwonhu umwempela banji banooba bakalulama.<verse eid="ROM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Mulawo wakabuya, kuti luchinyo luwande, asi panowanda luchinyo ishe jinowanda kasa, <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />kutila kuti luchinyo palunotonga mulufu, ishe jingatonga pezhulu pokululama, jitisenga kubupenyu businopela, nomunaJesu Kristo Tezi wedu.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s">Kuchinya kwombili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Ini zwatingalebe biya? Tingandila mbeli muluchinyo kuti ishe jiwande na? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Azwingabe alo! Zwingaba chini kuti isu takafa muluchinyo, tigale mwaluli? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Munoziba na kuti isu tose takabhabhatizwa muna Kristo Jesu, takabhabhatizwa mulufu lulwe? <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Nokudalo takajikwa naye mulufu nombhabhatizwo, sezwo Kristo akamuswa mubafi nolukujo lwaTate, isu neebo tingakwenda mubupenyu bupya.<verse eid="ROM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Kana takashanganiswa naye mulufu lunanga solulwe, chokomende tinooshanganiswa naye sokumuka kukwe. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Tinoziba kuti buntolo bwedu bwaka kahamilwa panchinjikwa naye, kutila kuti umbili unaluchinyo upalajwe, akale atichinooba balanda kuluchinyo. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Nokudalo yoyo wafa unosunungulwa muluchinyo. <verse eid="ROM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Asi kana takafa naKristo, tinobimba kuti nasu bo tichalalama naye. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Nokudalo tinoziba kuti Kristo nokumuswa kukwe mubafi, aachinofa kabili, lufu aluchina isimba pezhulu pape. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Lufu lwaakafa wakafila luchinyo kamwempela nokujiba, asi bupenyu bwanolalama unolalamila Mwali. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Imwi neebo mulokwelela kuzwilangalila sabakafa muluchinyo akale mulibapenyu kunaMwali munaJesu Kristo.<verse eid="ROM 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Musileke luchinyo lutonga mumibili yenu inopalala, mutobeleja zwilakamilo zwayo. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Musilekeje imhingu jenu jichinya sezwishingiso zwobubi, koga zwipileni imwi kunaMwali, sabanhu babhiswa mulufu bebuzwa mubupenyu, akale mupile nemhingu jenu kunaMwali sezwishingiso zwobululami. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Nokudalo luchinyo alutoba namasimba pezhulu penu, sezwo amupo pasi pomulawu asi mupo pasi peshe.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balanda bobululami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Ini biya? Tingachinya nokuti atipo pasi pomulawu na, koga pasi peshe? Mane pe! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Amutoziba na kuti mungozwipila kana kunani, sabalanda banowhilila, mubalanda boyo unhu wamunowhilila, woluchinyo, zwinosenga kulufu, kana wokuwhilila zwinosenga kubululami? <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Koga topa kuboka kunaMwali, kuti mwakabeli balanda boluchinyo, mwaba banowhilila nomwoyo muzwilayijo zwamwakawana munozu zwimwakazwipila. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />akale kuva pamwakasungunulwa muzwibi, mwaba balanda bobululami. <verse eid="ROM 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Ndikumulebeleka sonhu pezhulu pobutela bwenu. Nokudalo sezwo mwakabapila imhingu jenu mune zwisakalulama, akale muluchinyo lukulwana, nokudalo ngweno sengani imhingu jenu mukululama kobuchena.<verse eid="ROM 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Pamwakabeli balanda boluchinyo, mwaka bakasungunulwa mubululami. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Asi ini zwamwakawana muzwinhu yezwi zwamuneshoni nazwo ? Kujiba kwezwinhu yezwi lufu. <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Sezwo ngweno mwasungunulwa muluchinyo, akale mwaba balanda baMwali, indipilo yamunowana bupenyu buchena, mapejelejo bupenyu businopela. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Nokuti indipo yoluchinyo lufu, koga chipo cheshe chaMwali bupenyu businopela muna Kristo Jesu Tezi wedu.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s">Unkwejaniso unova mukulobolana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Amutoziba na banakwaina ndikumulebeleka naabo banoziba mulawo kuti mulawo unoshinga panhu kana echi umpenyu chete? <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Nezwo unhukaji ulolobolwa unosungwa nomulawu kundume uwe kana undume echi umpenyu, koga undume uwe angofa, mulawo unokwendelana nondume auchinoshinga. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Nokudalo, unowhi umpomboli angogala noumwe unhulume, undume uwe echi umpenyu. Asi kana undume uwe angoshayika, unosupuka pamulawu yoyu, akale angolobolwa noumwe unhulume aatoba umpomboli. <verse eid="ROM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Zwili alo banakwaina bangu, mwakafa mumulawo pezhulu pombili waKristo, kuti mube boumwe, kunaiye wakamuswa kubafi kuti tizwale unchelo waMwali. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Tichinolalama nokwenyama, ishungu jedu jokulakamila luchinyo, jakanyungumulwa nomulawu, jakabeshinga mumhingu jedu kuti kuzwalwe unchelo wolufu. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />koga ngweno tasupulwa kuva kumulawu, tafa kunozo zwabakatigajika mubuzike, kutila kuti tisishinge tili pasi pomulawu wantolo ulokwalwa asi mubupenyu bupya bwoMpepo.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulawo noluChinyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />“Ini zwatingalebe biya?” Tingati mulawo luchinyo na? Mane pe! Ngana kusakabeli nomulawu, andijaluluziba luchinyo. Ngana mulawo usakati, “Usichibe” andijaluziba kuti kuchiba ini. <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Asi luchinyo, palwakawana chibaka mumulawo, lwakabuza mwandili mishobo yose yoluchibo. Pasina mulawo luchinyo lulofa . <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Ndakabeli umpenyu kusanhu kwaba nomulawu, asi pawakatalwa undayo, luchinyo lwakamusilijwa, imi ndikafa; <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />iwo undayo yoyu wakabimbisa bupenyu wakaba lufu kwandili. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Nokuti luchinyo palwakawana chibaka mundayo, lwakandichengela, lukandibulaya.<verse eid="ROM 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Nezwo mulawo unchena, nondayo unchena, ulolulama akale umbuya. <verse eid="ROM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Yecho chibuya, ndicho na chakandibuzila lufu? Mane pe! Luchinyo lwakata alo, lwakashingisa zwibuya kubuza lufu mwandili , kutila kuti luchinyo lutondejelwe kuti luchinyo kasa, nondayijo ungata kuti luchinyo lube lukulwana kasa.<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusowhanana pakati pedu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Toziba kuti mulawo ngowompepo; koga imi ndili wenyama, ndakatengeswa muluchinyo. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Anditozwiwhisisa zwito zwangu. Nokuti anditota zwandinoda, koga ndinota yecho chinhu chandinobenga. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Kana ndita yecho chandisinoda kuta, ndovumila kuti mulawo wakalulama. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Nezwo akuchili imi ndikumuzwita asi luchinyo lunogala mwandili. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Nokuti ndinoziba kuti apana zwibuya zwinogala mwandili, zwimo munyama yangu. Ndineshungu yokuta zwakalulama, asi anditozwita. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Nokuti anditota zwibuya zwandinoda, asi zwibi zwandisinoda kuta ndizwo zwandinota. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Feno kana ndita zwandisinoda, andichi imi ndikumuzwita, asi luchinyo lunogala mwandili.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Nezwo ndowana kuti kunoba mulawo, pandinoda kuta zwibuya, bubi bunoba pelyo. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Ndoshantila mulawo waMwali, nechomuntika mwangu, <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />asi ndinobona jimwe jemhingu jangu, jitobela mulawo unolwisana nomulawu wendangalilo yangu, undita unzike womulawu woluchinyo iwo unogala mumhingu jangu. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Imi nhu unoyangata! Ndiyani uchandisungunula munoyu umbili wolufu? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Tinoboka Mwali munaJesu Kristo Tezi wedu! Nezwo, indangalilo jangu jinoshingila mulawo waMwali, asi umbili wangu unoshingila mulawo woluchinyo.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s">Bupenyu bwoMpepo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Nokudalo ngweno apachina kulashwa kunabo baimo munaKristo Jesu. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Nokuti mulawo wompepo wobupenyu munaKristo Jesu wandisupula kuva kumulawu woluchinyo nolufu. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Nokuti Mwali wata zwakabakona kutiwa nomulawu pezhulu pobutela bwenyama, akatuma mwananhulumyana uwe muntojaniso wenyama inaluchinyo, etila luchinyo, wakalasha luchinyo elimunyama, <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />kuti zwimo mumulawo zwilokwelela kuti zwizhajikijwe kwatili isu tisinokwenda nokwenyama, koga nokwompepo . <verse eid="ROM 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Nokuti yabo banolalama nozwenyama banobiga miyeyo yabo muzwinhu zwenyama, koga yabo banolalama noMpepo banobiga miyeyo yabo muzwinhu zwompepo. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Kubiga miyeyo munazwenyama kunobuza lufu, asi kubiga miyeyo muMpepo kunobuza bupenyu nolunyalalo. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Miyeyo inobigwa panazwenyama inolwisana naMwali; aitowhilila mulawo waMwali, ndimo kasa aitotubula; <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Akale yabo baimo munyama abatotubula kushantisa Mwali.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Asi amwimo munazwenyama, mumo muMpepo, kana uMpepo waMwali ugala mwamuli wose unhu usina uMpepo waKristo aatobeli uwe. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Koga kana Kristo eli mwamuli, kojoba mibili yenu yakafa pezhulu poluchinyo, mipepo yenu mipenyu pezhulu pokululama. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Kana uMpepo woyo wakamusa Jesu kubafi ugala mwamuli, Iye wakamusa Kristo Jesu mubafi, unoopa bupenyu mumibili yenu inopalala, akale nomuMpepo uwe, unogala munamwi.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Nokudalo, banakwaina tibacheneki, kusi kulalama kwenyama, kuti tilalame nokwenyama - <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />nokuti mungolalama nokwenyama munoofa, asi kana noMpepo mupalaja zwito zwenyama muchalalama. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Nokuti bose yabo banotungamililwa noMpepo waMwali bana baMwali . <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />“Nezwo amujakatambula umpepo wobulanda kuti muwile mushule mulutyo, koga mwakatambula uMpepo wokuba bana baMwali. Kana tishomeja titi Abha! Tate!” <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />umpepo nokukwe unopa busumikiji bwompepo wedu kuti tibana baMwali, <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />kana tili bana, tibalyi befuma, balyi befuma yaMwali akale tibalyi befuma naKristo, yopo patinoyabula pamwempela naye, tinookujwa tilitose naye.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukujo lwambeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Ndikalinga kuti kuyangata kupo nonshaji youno akungakwelane nolukujo luchootondejwa kunasu. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Nokuti zwibumbwa zwilomilila neshungu kutondejelwa kwabana baMwali; <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />nokuti zwibumbwa zwakamuka nokulambwa kuti kusizhajikijwe chinangwa, kusi kuda kwazwo koga mukuda kukwe iye wakazwibiga mulubimbo; <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />nokuti zwibumbwa izwo zwinoosungunulwa kuva mubulanda bwazo bwokubola akale zwiwane lukujo luna lusungunuko lwabana baMwali. <verse eid="ROM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Toziba kuti zwose zwibumbwa zwabemimila zwilwajilwa pamwempela kuswikila ngweno; <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />akale atoba zwibumbwa chete, koga nasu nokwedu, tina michelo yotanga yoMpepo, tinomimila nechomukati, tikamilila kutambulwa sabana, nolusupuko lwemibili yedu. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Nokuti mulubimbo yolu takachijwa. Koga lubimbo lunoboneka alutoba lubimbo. Ndiyani unobimba muchinhu chabweni? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Asi kana tibimba kunoozwo zwatisinobona, tinozwimilila nomwoyo undefu.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Nokudalo uMpepo unotibhancha mubutela bwedu; nokuti atitoziba kunamata sezwatilokwelela, koga uMpepo nokukwe unotilebelela isu tinomimila namawhi atinokona kuleba. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Akale yoyo unoshaka myoyo yabanhu unoziba zwimo mundangalilo joMpepo, nokuti bachena banolebelelwa nompepo nokuda kwaMwali.<verse eid="ROM 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Toziba kuti muzwinhu zwose Mwali unota zwibuya eli naabo banounda, baloshobwa nechinangwa chiche. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Nezwo yabo baakaziba kale wakamuka nokubashala kuti bebe nechimo choMwananhulumyana uwe, kutila kuti ebe imbano pakati pabanakwaina banji. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Akale naabo baakashala kale wakabashoba, akale naabo baakashoba wakabalulamisa ; naabo baakalulamisa, neebo wakabakuja.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ludo lwaMwali munaKristo Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Totini biya pezhulu pezwi? Kana Mwali eli kubhazu lyedu, ndiyani angatilwisa? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Iye wakapila mwananhulumyana uwe, etila isu, angakonwa chini kutipa zwimwe zwose naiye? <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Ndiyani angapa undandu kuna baloshalwa naMwali? NdiMwali unobalulamisa, <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />biya ndiyani uchapa undandu? Angaba Kristo Jesu na, iye wakafa, eya, iye wakamuka mubafi, ugele kululyi lwaMwali, iye emene unotikumbilila? <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Ndiyani angatipambulanya noludo lwaKristo? Kungaba bujiili na, kana kusheta, kana luyabiso, kana ibhamba, kana bunkuna, kana impalajo, kana igwalabaza? <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Sezwilokwalwa kuwhi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">“Timubulayilwa imwi unshaji wose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:36">tilotolwa semhwizi jimunda kunobulayiwa.”<verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Pe, muna yezwi zwinhu zwose tibazundi nomuna iye wakatida. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Ndinechokomende kuti akutoba lufu kana bupenyu, kana ingilozi, kana bakulwana kulwana, kana zwinhu zwipo ngweno, kana zwikumuzha, kana isimba, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />kana bulefu, kana untika, kana chimwe zwacho chinhu chakabumbwa, chingatubula kutipambulanya noludo lwaMwali munaKristo Jesu, Tezi wedu.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s">Mwali nabanhu Babe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Ndikumuleba ilebeswa munaKristo, andijikumuniepa, indangalilo yangu inowililana noMpepo uNchena mukupa busumikiji kwandili, <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />kuti ndineshungu ihulwana kasa nokulwajilwa kwomoyo kusinopela. <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />Nezwo imi ndaluba nechido chokuti ngana ndafhizhwa ndikabhiswa kuva munaKristo kutilwa banakwaina bangu, bokunasu nokwoluji. <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />Ibo baIzilayeli, akale bwana bunhulumyana ngobwabo, lukujo, zwivumilano, kutalwa kwomulawu, kunamata nezwibimbiso, <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />kunaibo kunowanikwa matategulu, akale oluji lwabo, sozwenyama, Ndiye Kristo. Mwali upo pezhulu paizwo zwose ngekombolelwe kwemisi isinopela. Ameni.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Asi azwitoba sokuti iwhi lyaMwali lyakakonelwa. Nokudalo atoba ibo bose benzwalo yokwaIzilayeli bali baIzilayeli, <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />akale akutoba kuti ibo bose bana baAbhulahamu nokuti ndibenzwalo yiye koga Mwali wakati,“Inzwalo yiyo ichashobelwa muzina lyaIsaki.” <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Yezwi zwinoleba kuti bana baMwali atoba bana benyama, koga bana bechibimbiso ndibo banolingwa sechizekululu. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Yezwi ndizwo zwakalebwa nechibimbiso kuti, “Nonshaji unanga sono ndinoobuya, akale Sala unooba nomwananhulumyana.”<verse eid="ROM 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Akale zwisili yezwi chete, koga neebo Labheka paakaba nemimba yabana nonhulume umwempela, tategulu bedu Isaki, <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />kojoba basakabanu bazwalwa, akale besanu bata chinhu chibuya kana chibi, kutila kuti chinangwa chaMwali chenshalujo chindile mbeli kusili kuti pezhulu pemishingo asi pezhulu pokushoba kukwe, <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />wakabujwa kuti, “Unkulwana unooshingila untukutuku.” <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />Sezwo zwilokwalwa kuti, “Ndakada Jakobe, asi Isawu ndakombenga.”<verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Ini zwatingalebe biya? Kuna kusolulama na kubhazu lyaMwali? Azwili alo pe! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Nokuti unoti kunaMozesi, “Ndinooba neshe kunoyo wandinowhila ishe, akale ndinooba neshungu kunoyo wandinowhila ishungu.” <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Nezwo azwitonda nechido kana kukweja kwonhu, asi pezhulu peshe jaMwali. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Lukwalo luchena lunoti kuna Falo, “Ndakakulela ndili nechinangwa chokutondejela isimba lyangu mwauli, kutila kuti izina lyangu lipupulwe munyika yose.” <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Nezwo uneshe pezhulu paani naani azwe waanoda akale unokomesa moyo wayoyo waanoda kukomesela.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ishe jaMwali nokunyema kukwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Pakalepo iwi unooti kwandili,“Ini biya ewana undandu? Nokudalo ndiyani angalamba chido chiche?” <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Asi uli ani iwi, unhu, ungashandulana naMwali? Chibumbwa chingati kumbumbi wacho, “Wakandibumbilani ali”.? <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Ani umbumbi aana isimba na pezhulu pevu, kuti ebumbe nevu lyakalelo chibigilo chokuyeba nechokushingisa.<verse eid="ROM 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Kana Mwali eda kutitondejela bukali bubwe akale kuti isimba lilye lizibikane, wakaba nomwoyo undefu kuzwibigilo zwobukali zwakabumbilwa kupalajwa, <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />kutila kuti kuzibikane ifuma yolukujo lulwe kuti zwibigilo zweshe jije, yezwo zwaakabambanyila pakutanga kutila lukujo, <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />nasubo baakashoba, zwisinova kubaJuda chete, asi naBokuzhe naibo? <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Ndizwo zwaanoleba munaHosiya eti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">“Yabo basijakabeli banhu bangu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">ndinoobashoba kuti ‘banhu bangu,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">akale noyo usakabeli undikani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">ndinoonshoba kuti ‘undiwa wangu.’ ”<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />‘Mubugalo yobwo pazwakalebwa kwabali kuti, ‘Amutoba banhu bangu’,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">banooshobwa kuwhi ‘bana baMwali umpenyu. ’ ”<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Isaya unoshomeja kasa nozwaIzilayeli eti: “Kojoba bana baIzilayeli beli banji sonseche wegungwa, asi bashoma babo chete ndibo bachoochijwa; <verse eid="ROM 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />nezwo Tezi unoopa untongo ulolulama akale nokukambijisa, pezhulu penyika.” <verse eid="ROM 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Sezwaakaleba mbeli Izaya eti, “Ngana Tezi wezwibumbwa esakatisiyila zwizekululu, taluba seSodoma tikatiwa seGomola.”<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">BaIzilayeli neNdebo iMbuya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Ini zwatingalebe, biya? Kuti Bokuzhe basijakatobela bululami, bakabuwana, ndikwo kuti bululami bwokudimbwa; <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />asi kuti Izilayeli wakatobela bululami bumile pamulawu ajakabhudilila mukuzhajikija mulawo yoyo. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Ini biya? Nokuti abajakabutobela nokudimbwa asi bakazwita sokuti zwakabeli zwemishingo. Bakagubhulwa nebwe lyechikonejo, <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />sezwo zwikakwalwa, kuti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">“Lingani, ndimubiga ibwe muZiyoni, lichagubhula banhu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">mwala uchata kuti bembwele;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">akale yoyo unodimbwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">kwaali aatoswabiswa neshoni.”<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Banakwaina, chido chomoyo nomunamato wangu kunaMwali ngowokuti ibo bechijwe. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Ndobasumikijila kuti balozwipila kasa kunaMwali, asi zwisina luzibo. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Nokusoba noluzibo lwobululami bunova kunaMwali, akale beda kushaka bwabo, abajakazwipila kubululami bwaMwali. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Nokuti Kristo Ndiye mapejelejo omulawu, kuti ani naani unodimbwa unolulamiswa.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luchijo ngilwonhu wose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Mozesi unokwala kuti unhu unotobeleja bululami bwomulawu unoogala nenzila yakaleyo. <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Asi bululami bwokudimbwa bunoti; Usiti mumwoyo uwo, “Ndiyani biya uchenda kudenga?” (yoku kudeleja Kristo) <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />kana kuti “Ndiyani uchenda kunomila?” (ndikokuti, kunomusa Kristo kuna bakafa). <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Koga limulebani? Iwhi lipo pelyo nawi, pandomo uwo akale nomumoyo uwo (ndilo iwhi lokudimbwa litinobhaunula), <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />nokuti, kana uleba nondomo uwo kuti Jesu ndiShe, akale udimbwa mumwoyo uwo kuti Mwali wakoumusa mubafi, unoochijwa. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Nokuti unhu unodimbwa nomwoyo uwe nezwo unolulamiswa, unoleba nondomo uwe nezwo unochijwa. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Iwhalo inchena inoti, “Akuna unodimbwa kwaali, uchooswabiswa.” <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Nokudalo apana unsiyano pakati koNjuda noNgiliki, nokuti wakaleyo Tezi, ndiShe waibo bose, akale unopa bufumi bubwe kunaibo bose banoshoba izina lilye. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Nokuti wose unoshoba izina lyaShe, unochijwa.<verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Asi banhu bangonshoba chini iye, ibo besakadimbwa kunaiye? Akale bangadimbwa chini kwaali ibo besanu bawha nezwizwe? Akale bangawha chini pesina umbhaunuli? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Akale banhu bangabhaunula chini kuzhe kwokuti batumwa? Sezwo zwakakwalwa kuti, “Kubuya chini kushanyilwa naabo, banobhaunula iNdebo iMbuya!” <verse eid="ROM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Asi atoba ibo bose bakawhilila iNdebo iMbuya, nokuti Izaya unoti, “Tezi, ndiyani wakadimbwa zwaakawha kwatili? <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Nezwo kudimbwa kunova munozwatinowha, akale zwinowhiwha zwinozha nokupupula kwaKristo.<verse eid="ROM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Koga ndinobhuza, abajakawha na? Chokomende bakawha; nokuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">“Iwhi lyabo lyenda munyika yose ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:18">akale namawhi abo kumapejelejo enyika.”<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />“Akale ndobhuza, Izilayeli aijakawhisisa na? Pakutanga Mozesi unoti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">“Ndinoomuta kuti mube nefupa kunabo basiluji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">ndinooshingisa luji lwamalema uti munyetele.”<verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Ngweno Izaya wabhudila pachena eti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">“Ndakawanikwa nabo basakandishaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:20">Ndikazwitondejela kunaabo basakabhuza nozwangu.”<verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Koga nozwabaIzilayeli unoti, “Izhuba lyose ndatambunuja maboko angu kubanhu basinowhilila akale banondishandukila.”<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s">Ishe jaMwali kuba Izilayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />Ndibhuze biya, Mwali wakalasha banhu babe na? Mane pe! Imi nokwangu ndili uIzilayeli, inzwalo yaAbhulahamu, wemhingu yoluji lwaBhenjamini. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Mwali ajalasha banhu babe baakaziba kuva ntolo. Amutoziba kuti unkwalo unotini nezwaElija, kuti unoteteja chini kunaMwali pezhulu paIzilayeli? Unoti: <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />“Tezi, bakabulaya bapolofeti benu, bakolomola matebulilo, kwasala imi ndoga , akale bakumuda kundibulaya.” <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Koga inshandulo yaMwali kwaali ngeipi? Wakati, “Ndakazwilondotela zwiulu zwishanu zwina zwibili zwabanhu basijanu bafhugamila Bhali. <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Zwili alo nanasi, baipo bakasiyijwa bakashalwa neshe jije. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Koga kana zwili pezhulu peshe, azwichili zwemishingo; nokuti ngana zwisakadalo ishe ajijaluba ishe.<verse eid="ROM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Ini biya? Izilayeli yakakonwa kuwana zwayakabeshaka. Bakashalwa ndibo bakawana, koga bamwe bose bakaba nemyoyo mikukutu, <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />sezwo zwilokwalwa kuwhi, “Mwali wakabapa umpepo</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 11:8">wokulalisa ihope, namesho asinobona nenzebe jisinowha kuswikila izhuba lyanasi.”<verse eid="ROM 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Davidi unoti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">“Zwokulya zwabo ngazwibe kalabwi kanobateya, nedizwa linobapinga;<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />mesho abo ngaabe nedubi kutila kuti besibone,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">akale bekotamise mishana yabo kwemisi isinopela!”<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Nokudalo ndinobhuza, bakagubhulwa kuti bembwele na?Mane pe! Koga pezhulu poluchinyo lwabo luchijo lwaswika kuna Bokuzhe kutila kuti bokwaIzilayeli bebe nefupa. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Ngweno kana luchinyo lwabo lufumisa inyika, akale kana kukonwa kwabo kufumisa Bokuzhe, biya zwinooba chini pabachochingunuka bose!<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luchijo lwaBokuzhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Ngweno ndikumulebeleka namwi Bokuzhe. Sezwo ndili umpositoli kunaBokuzhe, ndinotunhumwija unshingo wangu <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />kutila kuti banakwaina bangu baJuda, bebe nefupa akale bewane kuchijwa pezhulu pangu. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Kana kulambwa kwabo kuleba kuchingunuka kwenyika, biya kutambulwa kwabo kunolebani, kunoleba kupa bupenyu kunabakafa!<verse eid="ROM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Kana buswa bulofuwiwa bunopilwa semichelo yotanga buli buchena, nechifuwo chose chili alo; akale kana unji uli unchena nenhabi jili alo. <verse eid="ROM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Asi kana jimwe inhabi jakaba jatemwa, iwi uli katabi ko-olivi womushango, kova unamatijwa pajakava, kuti mukobane bufumi bwonti we-olivi, <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />leka kuzwikuja pezhulu penhabi. Kana ungozwikuja, kumbulukwa kuti autoba iwi unosimikija miji, asi miji ndiyo inokusimikija iwi.<verse eid="ROM 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Unooti, “Inhabi jakatemwa kutila kuti imi ndinamatijwe pakale.” <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Yelyo ichokomende. Jakatemwa pezhulu pokusodimbwa kwajo, asi iwi bhatisisa chete nokudimbwa kukwo. Nokudalo usizwikuje koga gala ukatya. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Nokuti kana Mwali esakawhila ishe inhabi jomene, nawi aatokuwhila ishe. <verse eid="ROM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Linga bubuya nobukali bwaMwali kunaabo bakawa, koga ishe jaMwali kwauli kana ugala mushe jije; kana zwisakadalo nawibo unootemwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Akale bamwe kana bangosiya kusodimbwa kwabo, banoonamatijwa nokuti Mwali unesimba lyokubanamatija kabili. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Nokuti kana iwi wakabatemwa kuva ponti weolivi womushango, kova unamatijwa, zwisinokwendelana namamelelo onti munti we olivi unolimwa, zwilelu chini kuti yeji inhabi jomene chinamatijwe ponti wajo weOlivi.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ishe jaMwali kuna ibo bose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Nino musishiye muti mulochenjela, ndinoda kuti muwhisise isiswa yeyi banakwaina; chimwe chikamu cheIzilayeli chakomesa moyo, kujine chilabo chose chaBokuzhe jangwina, <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />nezwo Izilayeli yose inoochijwa, sezwilokwalwa kuwhi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">“uNchiji unova kuZiyoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:26">,uchoobhisa kusoba nobumwali kunduji jaJakobe”;<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />“yechi ndicho chichaba chivumilano changu nabo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:27">yopo pandichoobhisa luchinyo lwabo.”<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Tikalingana neNdebo iMbuya, zwita zwaMwali, kutila imwi; asi tikalingana nokushalujwa, balodikana pezhulu pamatategulu abo. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Nokuti zwipo akale nokushoba kwaMwali azwitofa zwashanduka. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Sezwo umwe unshaji musakawhilila Mwali, asi ngweno mwatambula ishe, pezhulu pokusowhilila kwabaJuda, <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />nezwo ngweno baba basinowhilila kutila kuti neshe jakatondejelwa kwabali, betambule ishe neebo. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Nokuti Mwali wabiga banhu bose mukusowhilila, kuti ebe neshe kubanhu bose.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukujo kunaMwali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Aaa! Untika wefuma, buchenjevu noluzibo lwaMwali! Kutonga kukwe akutoshakika nenzila jije ajitowhisisika.<verse eid="ROM 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />Ndiyani wakaziba indangalilo yaTezi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:34">kana ndiyani wakaba undayi uwe?”<verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />“Kana kuti ndiyani wakapa chipo kwaali kuti obwilizilwa na?”<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Nokuti kuva kuna iye nomuna iye zwinhu zwose zwakatiwa. Kuna iye ngakube lukujo kwemisi isinopela. Ameni.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s">Bupenyu mukushingila Mwali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Ndinomukumbila banakwaina bangu, neshe jaMwali, kuti mupile mibili yenu sombhayilo umpenyu, unchena akale unotambulika kunaMwali, kunoba ikwo kunamata kwenu kwompepo. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Musitobeleje zwenyika yeyi asi mushandulwe mundangalilo jenu jibe impya kutila kuti muzibe chido chaMwali, munazwibuya nezwinotambulika akale zwilopelelela.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Nokudalo nechipiwo chandakapiwa ndinoti kunoumwe noumwe, upo pakati penu, esizwikukumaje kupinda zwaali, koga ngezwideleje mundangalilo, zwinda nokudimbwa kwaakapiwa naMwali. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Nokuti mumbili umwempela tinemhingu inji, akale imhingu jose jina unshingo ulosiyana, <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />zwakadalo isu, kojoba tilibanji,tiumbili umwempela munaKristo, umwe noumwe imhingu ilosiyana yombili umwempela. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Tili nezwipo zwilosiyana nokuda kweChipiwo jatakapiwa isu, ngatizwishingiseni: kungaba kupolofita, zwikwendelana nokudimbwa kwedu; <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />kana kuli kushinga, ngatishingeni, unolayija, ngelayije, <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />iye unosungwaja, ngesungwaje, iye unobhancha, ngebhanche mulusungunuko, iye unopa ngesungwale mukukoba , iye unaneshe, ngete nolushanta.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Ludo ngalube lwomene, bengani zwibi, bhatililani kasa muzwibuya. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Dananani noludo lwobwanakwaina: Sungwalani mukulemekejana. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Musilengwale, vilimani mumpepo, mushingile Tezi. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Shantani mukubimba kwenu, mube nomwoyo ndefu mukusheta, bhatisani mukunamata <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Babhancheni bachena nezwabanoshayiwa, mutambule bezi namaboko mabili.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Kombolelani yabo banomujiija; bakomboleleni musibafhizhe. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Ishantani nabo banoshanta, mulile nabo banolila. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Gajikanani mulunyalalo; musizwinyamule koga lyijanani nabanhu bopasi akale musishiye.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Musibwilizile chibi nechibi, asi muyeye kuta zwibuya pambeli kwaibo bose. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Kana zwitubulika akale zwili mumasimba enu, galani mulunyalalo naibo bose. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Banodikana, imwi musibwilizile, asi zwisiyileni kubukali bwaMwali, sezwo zwilokwalwa kuwhi,“ lubwilizilo ngolwangu, ndichabwilizila, unodalo She.” <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Kana umbengi uwo eli nezhala, umpe zwokulya, kana eli nenyota umpe zwokunwa, nokuta alo unobebutitika masimbe anopisa pansholo uwe. <verse eid="ROM 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Musizundwe nobubi, koga komani bubi nobubuya.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s">Kulemekeja butongi benyika</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Unhu wose ulokwelela kuba pasi pamasimba obutongi. Nokuti akuna butongi kuzhe kwobo bunova kuna Mwali, akale nobwo bupo bwakabigwa naMwali. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Nokudalo iye unolamba butongi walamba zwabigwa naMwali, akale yabo banolamba banopiwa untongo. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Nokuti batongi abatotyisa kuna yabo banota zwibuya, koga kuna yabo banota zwibi. Amungontye nayoyo upo pabutongi? Nezwo itani zwakalulama akale munoowana lukujo lulwe, <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />nokudalo unshingi waMwali, wokubhancha imwi. Koga kana muta zwisakalulama, ityani, nokuti iye atongobhata chete igwalabaza esalishingisa; iye unshingi waMwali unolanga umbipisi. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Nokudalo munokwelela kuba pasi pobutongi, kusikutizha bukali bwaMwali kuli kutila luyeyo pezhulu pokuziba zwibi nezwibuya.<verse eid="ROM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Nechisoko chimwempela molipa untelo, nokuti batongi, bashingi baMwali, belikumuta chinhu chakale yechi. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Lipani bose indipilo yabo, untelo ilipani kwaunokwelela, imali kwainokwelela kulipwa, lulemekejo kunoyo unokwelela kulemekejwa, lukujo kunoyo unokwelela kukujwa.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inkwelelo kunomwe nomwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Usibe nechikweleti kunomwe, koga mudanane chenuchenu , nokuti yoyo unoda umbakijani uwe wazhajikija mulawo. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Milayo inoti “Usimbombole, usibulaye,usikwibe, usichibe,” neimwe milayo zwayo, iloshanganiswa muchilebo yechi chinoti, “Ida umbakijani uwo sobunozwida iwi”. <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Ludo alutota chibi kumbakijani, nokudalo ludo luzhajikijo lwomulawu.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Kuzhe kwezwi munoziba kuti unshajini, waswika unshaji ngweno kuti mumuke mukulala kwenu. Luchijo lwabapelyo nasu ngweno, kupinda patakatanga kudimbwa, <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Busiku bwapinda, kwaleboja. Nezwo ngatilasheni mishingo yenhilima, tibige chitabilijo chechimuniko. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Atiteni zwilokwelela kutiwa masikati, zwisili zwokunakilwa mulidupwa, nokukolwa, zwisili zwobusangu nobuhungu, zwisili zwokukakabajana kana luchibo. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Imbalani Tezi Jesu Kristo, asi musishake kushantisa mibili muzwilakamilo zwayo.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s">Musitonge bamwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Unhu unakudimbwa kushoma, untambuleni, koga musikakabajane naye pezhulu pokusiyana naye munjeyo. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Umwe unodimbwa kuti angalya chili chose, koga unhu unakudimbwa kushoma unolya undibo chete. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Yoyo unolya ajilokwelela kushunda yoyo usinolya, akale yoyo usinolya ajilokwelela kutonga yoyo unolya nokuti Mwali wakotambula. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Uli ani iwi kupa untongo kunshingi womwe? Zwiko kunaTezi uwe kuti ebe iye unoleba bubi nobubuya bwonshingi uwe. Tezi unoontunhumwija akale onte kuti ebhudilile.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Umwe unhu unokujisisa izhuba limwempela kuti ibuya kupinda limwe, koga umwe unhu unokuja mazhuba ose zwilokwelana. Umwe nomwe ngebe nokugunchikana kuzhele mundangalilo jije. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Iye unolemekeja izhuba, unolilemekeja ekuja Tezi. Iye unolya, neebo unolya ekuja Tezi, sezwo unopa kuboka kunaMwali; yoyo unoleka, unoleka ekuja Tezi akale unopa kuboka kunaMwali. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Akuna umwe wedu unozwilalamila akale akuna umwe wedu unozwifila. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Kana tilalama tolalamila Tezi, akale kana tifa tofila Tezi nokudalo kojoba tili bapenyu kana tingofa tili baTezi. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Nokuti Kristo wakafa akamuka mukufa, kutila kuti ebe Tezi wabakafa nabapenyu. <verse eid="ROM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Ini upa untongo kumwanakwaina uwo? Kana iwi ini ushunda mwanakwaina uwo? Nokuti tose tinooma mbeli kwechigalo chobutongo bwaMwali.<verse eid="ROM 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />“Zwandili umpenyu, unodalo Tezi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">chose chivi chinoondifhigamila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">akale lwose lulimi lunookuja Mwali.”<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Nokudalo umwe noumwe wedu unozwishandulila kunaMwali.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musiwige bamwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Nokudalo ngatilekeni kupa untongo kunabamwe, koga yeyani kuti musibinde kana kubiga chikoneso munzila yomwanakwaina. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Ndinoziba akale ndilobwetekejwa munaShe Jesu kuti chinhu chose chichena, koga chiloswibhijwa nendangalilo joyo unochiyeya alo. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Kana mwanakwaina uwo elwajilwa nozwo zwaunolya, auchinokwenda muludo. Usivumile zwaunolya kuti zwiwige umwe wakafilwa naKristo. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Nokudalo musileke bubuya bwenu bulebelekwa sobubi. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Nokuti bushe bwaMwali abutobeli kulya nokunwa, asi kululama nolunyalalo nokushanta muMpepo uNchena. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Iye unoshingila Kristo unotambulwa kunaMwali akale unotambulwa nabanhu.<verse eid="ROM 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Ngatitobelejeni yozwo zwinobuza lunyalalo, akale nokukubusana mukubakana. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Musibulaye unshingo waMwali pezhulu pokulya. Zwose zwichena kasa, koga zwibi kuti umwe ewige bamwe pezhulu pezwaanolya, <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />zwilolulama kusolya inyama kana kusonwa iwayini kana kuta chimwe chinhu chingagubhula mwanakwaina uwo. <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Londota luvumilo lwaunanalo, pakati papo naMwali; uloshanta yoyo usina chisoko chokuzwipa untongo muna zwaanovumila. <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Koga iye unokahajika unolashwa, kana akalya, nokuti ajimuzwita mukudimbwa, nokuti zwose zwinotiwa mukusodimbwa luchinyo.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s">Shantisani bamwe, musizwishantise imwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Isu tinamasimba tilokwelela kuba nomwoyo undefu nokukonelwa kwabo basina isimba, akale tisizwishantise isu nokwedu, <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />umwe nomwe wedu ngeshantise umbakijani uwe kuti zwibe zwibuya kwaali, kuti ombake. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Nokuti Kristo iye ajakazwishantisa, asi sezwilokwalwa kuti, “Kutuka kwaabo bakamutuka, kwakawila panami.” <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Zwose zwakabakakwalwa mumazhuba antolo, zwakabakakwalilwa kulayija isu, kuti nokubhatilila akale nokukutaijwa namakwalo machena, kuti tingaba nolubimbo. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Mwali womoyo undefu nobusungwaji, ngana amupa bupenyu bogajikana nabamwe mulunyalalo, munaKristo Jesu, <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />kuti pamwempela mube newhi limwempela mukukuja Mwali akale beli Tate baTezi wedu Jesu Kristo.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">INdebo iMbuya kuna Bokuzhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Tambulanani, nokuti, Kristo wakamutambula imwi, kutila lukujo lwaMwali. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Nokudalo ndomubuja kuti Kristo wakaba unshingi kuna bakamhalajwa kutondejela buchokomende bwaMwali, kutila kuzhajikija zwibimbiso zwakatiwa kumatategulu, <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />akale kutila kuti Bokuzhe bekuje Mwali mushe jije. Sezwo kulokwalwa kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">“Nokudalo ndinoomukuja pakati paBokuzhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:9">akale nokukwimbila izina lyenu,”<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />akale kunowhi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">“Shantani, imwi Bokuzhe nabanhu Babe.<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Akale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">“Kujani Tezi, imwi mose Bokuzhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">akale lekani banhu bose bonkuje,”<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Izaya unondila mbeli eti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">“Inzwalo yaJese inoozha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">Iye uchanyamuka kotonga Bokuzhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">Bokuzhe banoobimba naye.”<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Mwali wolubimbo, ngana amuzhaja mose nolushanto nolunyalalo mukudimbwa, kutila kuti nesimba lyoMpepo uNchena, muzhale lubimbo.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chisoko chaPaulo chokukwala esinotya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Imi nokwangu ndilogunchikana namwi banakwaina bangu, kuti imwi muzhele bubuya, muzhele luzibo lwose, akale motubula kulayijana. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Koga munolu lukwalo, ndamukwalila ndisinotya sechikumbulujo, pezhulu pechipiwo chindakapiwa naMwali, <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />kuba unshingi waKristo Jesu kuna bokuzhe wakandipa unshingo wobutebuji ndibhaunula iNdebo iMbuya yaMwali, kutila kuti umpilo waBokuzhe utambulike, ukacheneswa noMpepo uNchena. <verse eid="ROM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />MunaKristo Jesu, ndina chisoko chokushiya nonshingo wangu munaMwali. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Nokudalo anditolebeleka zwimwe zwinhu kuzhe kwezwinhu zwakatiwa naKristo endishingisa kuti ndizunde ndiwane kuwhililwa naBokuzhe, muwhi nomuzwito, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />nesimba lyezwitondejelo nezwichenamiso, nesimba lyoMpepo uNchena, kuti kuva kuJelusalema akale nokule kungaba sokuswika kuIilikumu, ndakapupula zwizhele iNdebo iMbuya yaKristo, <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />ndizwo zwakatisa kuti ndibe neshungu jokubhaunula iNdebo iMbuya, yoko Kristo kwaakabasanu abhaunulwa, kutila kuti ndisibakile pamagajikilo omwe unhu, <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />asi sezwilokwalwa kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">“Banoobona yabo bakabasanu babujwa neZwizwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">akale banoowhisisa yabo basakabanu bawha neZwizwe.”<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chilongwa chaPaulo chokushanyila kuRoma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Yechi ndicho chisoko chalundikoneja kuti ndizhe kwamuli. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Koga ngweno, sezwo ndisichina unshingo munaya mapazu, akale nokuti ndakabeshaka kuzha kwamuli kwamakole manji, <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />ndinobimba kuti ndomubona pandichapinda ndinda kuSipeyini, akale kuti ndibhanchwe namwi mulwendo lwangu lwokunda kwakale, ndashantilwa nokuba namwi konshaji unshoma. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Kwangweno ndikumunda kuJelusalema ndisenga lubhancho lwabachena. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Nokuti iMasedoniya neAkeya jakapila zwipo nolushanto kubachena bokuJelusalema banoshayiwa; <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />bakashantilwa kuta yezwi, akale chokomende bakabewha zwakakwelela, nokuti kana Bokuzhe bezha kuti bokobelana makombolelo abo oMpepo nabaJuda, banokwelela bo kuba nolubhancho mumakomboelo abo ozwenyika. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Nokudalo kana ndapeja yezwi, ndaswincha yezwi zwakawanikwa kunaibo, ndichapinda kwamuli mulwendo lwangu lwokunda kuSipeyini; <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />akale ndoziba kuti pandinozha kwamuli, ndozha kwamuli ndilizhele makombolelo aKristo.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Banakwaina, ndinomukumbilisisa, munaShe wedu Jesu Kristo nomuludo lwoMpepo, kuti mube pamwempela nami muminamato yenu kunaMwali mundinamatila, <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />kuti ndichijwe kunaibo basilodimbwa bokuJudiya, akale kuti lubhancho lwangu kuJelusalema lutambulike kubachena, <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />kutila kuti nechido chaMwali ndizhe kwamuli nolushanto, akale ndoonyetutukwa pakati penu. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Mwali wolunyalalo ebe namwi mose. Ameni.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s">Kumusana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Ndinomuzibisa nezwonkazwaji wedu Febhi, undikonikaji wegubungano lyokuKenikeliya, <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />kutila kuti muuntambule munaShe sezwilokwelela bachena, akale muumbhanche munazwose zwanoshaka kwamuli, nokuti wabeli umbhanchi wabanji akale nokunami. <verse eid="ROM 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Mumuse Pulisila naAkwila bashingikwaina bangu munaKristo Jesu, <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />ibo bakabiga bupenyu bwabo mungozi pezhulu pangu, kusili imi ndonga koga namakubungano ose aBokuzhe anoboka. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Mumuse iGubungano linoshanganila mungumba yabo. Mumuse Epenetasi unodikana, waluba wotanga kuchingunukila kunaKristo muEzhiya. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Mumuse Mariya washinga kasa pakati penu. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Mumuse Andilonikasi naJuniyasi, makamu angu akale basungwakwaina, banolemekejwa pakati pabapositoli akale bakanditangila kuba munaKristo. <verse eid="ROM 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Mumuse Ampiliyatasi, undiwa wangu munaShe. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Mumuse Abhanasi unshingikwaina wedu munaKristo naSitakisi undiwa wangu. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Mumuse Apelesi ulotambulwa munaKristo. Mumuse yabo bemhuli yaAlistobhulasi. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Mumuse Helodiyoni igamu lyangu, akale mumuse yabo baimo munaShe, bomumhuli yaNakisasi. <verse eid="ROM 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Mumuse yabo bashingi baTezi, Tilaifina naTilaifosa. Mumuse unodikana Pesisi, washinga kasa munaShe. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Mumuse Lufasi unkulugulu munaShe, akale naamai babe, belibangu neebo. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Mumuse Asingilitasi naFelegoni naHemisi, naPetilobhasi, naHemasi nabanakwaina babananabo. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Mumuse Filologasi naJuliya, naNeleyasi nonkazwaji uwe, naOlimpasi nabachena bose babananabo. <verse eid="ROM 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Imusanani umwe nomwe nokumyonta kuchena. Makubungano ose aKristo anomumusa.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Indayijo yopejeleja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Ndinomubweta banakwaina, kuti muchenjelele yabo banobuzilija kusowhanana, nobulemu zwinonyenyejana nezwilayijo zwimwakalayijwa; mubasiye. <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Nokuti banhu bakadalo abatoshingila Tezi wedu, Kristo, koga bamushingila zwilakamilo zwabo, banoshingisa mawhi abo benakisa lulimi bechengela myoyo yabasina luzibo. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Kuwhilila kwenu kunozibikana kunaibo bose, nezwo ndinoshantiswa namwi, koga ndinoda kuti mube namaano muzwinhu zwibuya akale musununguke muzwinhu zwibi; <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />nezwo Mwali wolunyalalo unopwanya Guluzhanje pasi pamakumbo enu. Ishe jaShe wedu Jesu Kristo jibe namwi. <verse eid="ROM 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Timoti unshingikwaina wangu, unomulezwa; naLusiyasi naJasoni naSosipatulo makamu angu anomulezwa neebo. <verse eid="ROM 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Imi Tetiyasi unkwali wolukwalo yolu, ndinomumusa munaShe. <verse eid="ROM 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Geyasi mweni wobugalo pandigele nopatinoshanganila negubungano lyose, unomumusa. Elasitasi umbhati wechikwama cheguta nomwanakwaina wedu Kotusi unomumusa. <verse eid="ROM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />Ishe jaShe wedu Jesu Kristo jibe namwi mose. Ameni.<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unamato wokukuja wopejeleja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Kunaiye unotubula kumusimisa nenzila yeNdebo iMbuya yangu yandinobhaunula nezwaJesu Kristo, sokufumulwa kwechichenamiso chakagajikwa musiswa kwonshaji undefu, <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />asi ngweno chakaba pachena akale mumakwalo abapolofeti, chinozibiswa kunyika jose, sechilayo chaMwali usinojiba kuti zwibuze kuwhilila kwokudimbwa. <verse eid="ROM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />lukujo ngalube kunaMwali umwempela unabuchenjevu, lini nalini nomunaJesu Kristo! Ameni.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>